[[0,9001,0,4,0,4,"2014-06-24T09:21:00","Mewtwo","",[],"<p>Archiving was one thing I did not like much about reddit but it was understandable, what does Atko think?</p>","Will whoaverse feature archiving?","","AskVoat"],[1,7276,0,1,0,1,"2014-06-24T14:18:00","Atko","",[],"<p>I am not familiar with reddits archiving. Would you care to elaborate?</p>"],[2,7280,7276,2,0,2,"2014-06-24T14:25:00","tz","",[],"<p>After 6 months, posts can no longer be replied to or upvoted. I think it's a good feature server-wise, not so much user...</p>"],[3,7951,7280,1,0,1,"2014-06-25T04:32:00","Atko","",[],"<p>No, I dont think will will impose such restrictions, I see no technical limitations that would force us to do so.</p>"],[4,8062,7951,0,0,0,"2014-06-25T06:40:00","Mewtwo","",[],"<p>Yessssss</p>"]]
